  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports an autonomous (self-driving) lab program running model-guided high-throughput experiments across catalysts, coatings, polymers, pharmaceuticals, and nanomaterials. Compared to manual benchwork, autonomous platforms compress design-make-test-analyze cycles 5-10x and routinely run 20-50 experiments per week per workflow. Stakeholders: R&D VP (yield, pass rate, time-to-lead), bench chemists (parameter optimization, model confidence), CFO (cost per experiment, program ROI).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Average yield = AVG(yield_pct) on experiment_runs; best-in-class catalysts 70-90%, polymers 60-85%\n- Pass rate = passed_experiments / total_experiments; target 75-85% for mature workflows\n- Purity = AVG(purity_pct); release-gate typical 95-99% for specialty chemicals\n- Cost per experiment = AVG(cost_per_experiment_usd); autonomous benchmark $200-$5,000/run\n- Model accuracy = AVG(model_prediction_accuracy_pct); \u2265 85% is well-calibrated\n- Yield headroom = best_yield_pct - avg_yield_pct; large gap = ripe optimization target\n- Confidence score = parameter_snapshots.confidence_score; \u2265 0.85 typically gates auto-execution\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - experiment_runs_metrics (source: experiment_runs) \u2014 dims: run_date, formulation_category, lab_facility, run_result; measures: total_experiments, passed_experiments, avg_yield_pct, avg_purity_pct, avg_reaction_time_minutes, max_yield_pct, total_temperature_c, total_pressure_bar, unique_formulation_count, max_temperature_c.\n  - optimization_monthly_metrics (source: optimization_monthly) \u2014 dims: report_month, formulation_category, formulation_id; measures: total_experiments_run, avg_pass_rate_pct, avg_yield_pct, avg_cost_per_experiment, avg_model_accuracy_pct, total_best_yield_percent, max_experiments_run.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. formulation_name, optimal_temp_c, predicted_yield_pct, confidence_score, experiments_to_date).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show monthly average yield by formulation category for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Top 10 formulations by best yield achieved this year \u2014 what is the gap to average yield?",
    "How has experiment pass rate trended month-over-month across lab facilities?",
    "Which formulations have a model confidence score above 0.85 with predicted yield > 80%?",
    "What is the total cost per experiment by formulation category over the last 6 months?",
    "Top 10 formulation categories by total experiments run \u2014 and how does model prediction accuracy compare?",
    "Which lab facilities have the lowest pass rate, and what is the cost-of-failure exposure?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How many distinct transactions appeared each month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', run_date) AS month, COUNT(DISTINCT transaction) AS distinct_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.experiment_runs",
        "GROUP BY 1",
        "ORDER BY 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average product yield percentage trended by month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT run_date, MEASURE(avg_yield_pct) AS avg_yield_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.experiment_runs_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY run_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average best yield percent trended by month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT report_month, MEASURE(total_best_yield_percent) AS total_best_yield_percent",
        "FROM {fqn}.optimization_monthly_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY report_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average model prediction accuracy changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT report_month, MEASURE(avg_model_accuracy_pct) AS avg_model_accuracy_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.optimization_monthly_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY report_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total reaction temperature in celsius over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT run_date, SUM(temperature_c) AS total_temperature_c",
        "FROM {fqn}.experiment_runs",
        "GROUP BY run_date ORDER BY run_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total model-recommended optimal temperature in celsius over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(optimal_temp_c) AS total_optimal_temp_c",
        "FROM {fqn}.parameter_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average percentage of experiments that passed changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT report_month, AVG(pass_rate_pct) AS avg_pass_rate_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.optimization_monthly",
        "GROUP BY report_month ORDER BY report_month"
      ]
    }
  ],
